Subject: [PATCH 3174/3799] soh: rename D_8015BD50 -> sKeepOn4ScratchA

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the first of three Vec3f scratch slots Camera_KeepOn4 keeps static; their roles are not established
Defined in soh/src/code/z_camera_data.inc.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_camera.c | 24 ++++++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

